      "content": "the problem is where do i even go?? if they've already flagged me like this, i'm worried they've shared my info or flagged my \"profile\" with others in the local network. it feels like they have a system to make it hard for people they want to push out to find anywhere else nearby. are there ways to move money that don't leave a trail they can see or intercept? like, how do i make sure they can't see my next move before i've actually made it?",
